WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Bookmark the useful position
Illustrative AIO record: positions cannot restore expired data.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Review what the file includes
Names, filters and positions can be sensitive. Payloads and credentials are excluded.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Export settings and positions
Record evidence is a separate export. Review before sharing.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Review and select a local profile
Importing the file does not connect or read records.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Open with positions unloaded
Read explicitly under your current credentials and protection.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Add the handover context
Include the question, UTC range, result, coverage gaps and next check.
